OL,3,GNEWSACall to fast track elected Thames
OL,4,AValley mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaders in the Thames Valley have
OL,7,Fwritten to the government in the hope
OL,8,Fof fast tracking plans for an elected
OL,9,Fmayor for the region.
OL,11,FCouncillors from Oxfordshire and
OL,12,FBerkshire said they wanted to set up a
OL,13,FMayoral Strategic Authority (MSA) as
OL,14,Fsoon as possible.
OL,16,FThat is despite continued disagreement
OL,17,Fover the proposed geography for the new
OL,18,Fauthority, with Swindon and
OL,19,FBuckinghamshire's inclusion still
OL,20,Fdividing opinion.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
